      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edison_Park%2C_Chicago"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood grew around a Chicago and Milwaukee Railroad stop, later becoming a streetcar suburb in the 20th century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edison_Park%2C_Chicago"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "One Hope United Methodist, Chicago’s oldest church building from 1894, traces its ministry back to pioneer Christian Ebinger.",
